adesc:aNowUndo V3.20 [slicer precis + crossfade, Cloud width = Stereo, Rec Density aleatoire, Auto-Replace par comparaison de niveau] [In/Out fix r12 brf+BRmix+SLmix] Looper (beat repeat) (sync point + reference master, slicer: auto-refresh each buffer change, Rate Link grid, auto-detect leger (enveloppe+seuil+hold), gate fix, master clock, steps, presets, max slices) (full hard-resync: reverse + exit slicer + leave stop + In/Out/speed rational)
options:gmem=nowundo_sync
options:maxmem=128000000
slider1:speed=1.0<0.01,100.0,0.01>-Speed
slider2:pitch=0.0<-48,48,0.01>-Pitch (st)
slider3:mix=1.0<0,1,0.01>-Mix
